OL,3,AHong Kong's first post-colonial leader
OL,4,Adies aged 89
OL,5,
OL,6,FTung Chee-hwa, Hong Kong's first leader
OL,7,Fafter the city returned to Chinese
OL,8,Frule, has died at the age of 89.
OL,10,FThe former shipping scion took over the
OL,11,Freins from the last British Governor
OL,12,FChris Patten in July 1997 when the UK
OL,13,Fhanded Hong Kong back to China, ending
OL,14,Fmore than 150 years of British control.
OL,16,FTung's rocky tenure was marked by the
OL,17,FAsian Financial Crisis, two major
OL,18,Fepidemics, and historic protests which
OL,19,Fattracted criticism of his
OL,20,Fadministration. He eventually resigned
OL,21,Fin 2005.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
