OL,3,AHong Kong's first post-colonial leader
OL,4,Adies aged 89
OL,5,
OL,6,FTung died on Tuesday night surrounded
OL,7,Fby loved ones, local media reported.
OL,8,FHis office described him as a man
OL,9,F"devoted to his country and its
OL,10,Fpeople".
